OL,7,FHe said over the course of the trial,  
OL,8,Fjurors would be told that Rainey,      
OL,9,Fformerly of James Street in Ballymena, 
OL,10,Fhad previously been prescribed         
OL,11,Fanti-psychotic medication.             
